1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:05,533
The commonest practical question: print a query's rows as an HTML table.

2
00:00:05,533 --> 00:00:11,549
Echo the opening table tag, then loop: each fetched row becomes one table row.

3
00:00:11,549 --> 00:00:13,424
The browser draws the result.

4
00:00:13,424 --> 00:00:20,611
fetch assoc gives an array keyed by column name; fetch row by number; fetch object gives an object.

